{"4627520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Smoke Easy: Hookah Lounge Simulator", "steam_appid": 4627520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your Hookah Lounge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b70fd960da534e99e0269a2ba6b23cf5.poster.avif?t=1777224826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b70fd960da534e99e0269a2ba6b23cf5.webm?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b70fd960da534e99e0269a2ba6b23cf5.mp4?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own hookah lounge and build it into the best spot in town! Take orders, prepare hookahs, keep the coals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  burning and grow your business from a cozy little place to a lounge everyone comes back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare hookah</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b29dc92b240dfc2a47325e19ea5a2628.poster.avif?t=1777224826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b29dc92b240dfc2a47325e19ea5a2628.webm?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b29dc92b240dfc2a47325e19ea5a2628.mp4?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the right tobacco flavor, pack the bowl, heat the coals and get the light just right before it goes out to the table. Rush it and your guests will notice - take your time and they'll be back tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handle the Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/c930c5daafc491befadbbd33ea0c036a.poster.avif?t=1777224826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/c930c5daafc491befadbbd33ea0c036a.webm?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/c930c5daafc491befadbbd33ea0c036a.mp4?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A busy night can turn on you fast. Coals overheat and harsh smoke sends guests coughing, a thief tries to slip out without paying, a hookah hits the floor and catches fire. Refresh the coals, catch the runner, grab the extinguisher - keep your cool when your lounge loses theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate &amp; Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/9c867d6ca495433e1b8d5329284d3082.poster.avif?t=1777224826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/9c867d6ca495433e1b8d5329284d3082.webm?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/9c867d6ca495433e1b8d5329284d3082.mp4?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your space, unlock new furniture and expand the lounge as your reputation grows. Choose your style: Warm &amp; Cozy / Dark &amp; Neon / Daylight Cafe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional</strong> <strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Team</strong>: Hire staff to give you a hand on daily tasks to run your lounge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Menu</strong>: Start with hookahs and unlock teas, drinks, food and a merchandise shop as your reputation grows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay Stocked</strong>: Reorder tobacco, coals and equipment through the PC and make sure you're always ready for the next day</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your Hookah Lounge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b70fd960da534e99e0269a2ba6b23cf5.poster.avif?t=1777224826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b70fd960da534e99e0269a2ba6b23cf5.webm?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b70fd960da534e99e0269a2ba6b23cf5.mp4?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own hookah lounge and build it into the best spot in town! Take orders, prepare hookahs, keep the coals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  burning and grow your business from a cozy little place to a lounge everyone comes back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare hookah</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b29dc92b240dfc2a47325e19ea5a2628.poster.avif?t=1777224826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b29dc92b240dfc2a47325e19ea5a2628.webm?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/b29dc92b240dfc2a47325e19ea5a2628.mp4?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the right tobacco flavor, pack the bowl, heat the coals and get the light just right before it goes out to the table. Rush it and your guests will notice - take your time and they'll be back tomorrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Handle the Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/c930c5daafc491befadbbd33ea0c036a.poster.avif?t=1777224826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/c930c5daafc491befadbbd33ea0c036a.webm?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/c930c5daafc491befadbbd33ea0c036a.mp4?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A busy night can turn on you fast. Coals overheat and harsh smoke sends guests coughing, a thief tries to slip out without paying, a hookah hits the floor and catches fire. Refresh the coals, catch the runner, grab the extinguisher - keep your cool when your lounge loses theirs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Decorate &amp; Expand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/9c867d6ca495433e1b8d5329284d3082.poster.avif?t=1777224826\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/9c867d6ca495433e1b8d5329284d3082.webm?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4627520/extras/9c867d6ca495433e1b8d5329284d3082.mp4?t=1777224826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your space, unlock new furniture and expand the lounge as your reputation grows. Choose your style: Warm &amp; Cozy / Dark &amp; Neon / Daylight Cafe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional</strong> <strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Dream Team</strong>: Hire staff to give you a hand on daily tasks to run your lounge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Menu</strong>: Start with hookahs and unlock teas, drinks, food and a merchandise shop as your reputation grows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay Stocked</strong>: Reorder tobacco, coals and equipment through the PC and make sure you're always ready for the next day</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Run y